fields.value:
 * Has the following targeting functionalities:
** {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Aura}} [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-1.png|84px]]
*** Creates a negative [[aura]] at the area-targeted location that applies the following ability effects:
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{A|Ancient Apparition|Bone Chill}}
***** No longer applies the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} upon leaving the negative aura radius.
***** The {{M|magic resistance}} reduction.
****** Stacks multiplicatively with other magic resistance sources.
***** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Ice Vortex cast range}}+{{#var:Ice Vortex value1}}}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
***** Grants {{M|flying vision}} centered around the area-targeted location for the entire duration.
** {{Symbol|Target|Portrait}}
*** Considers [[portrait-casting]] as a {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} ground-targeted cast, and centers the radius around Kaldr.

* {{Symbol|Target|Area-Inter}}
** Multiple overlapping Ice Vortex radius do not stack.

<!--* Deals  {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) within the radius for the entire duration, over {{calc|v1/dmg+1|v1={{#var:Ice Vortex value3}}}} damage instances with the aura linger duration.-->

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Ice Vortex icon0}}
| desc = Creates a vortex of icy energy that slows, deals damage, and increases magic damage done to enemies in its range.
}}
<hr>
* {{Symbol|a|Down}} {{Symbol|Magic Resistance}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} 
** Affected enemy heroes now {{Code|{{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1+v1)|v1={{#var:Ice Vortex value4}}|%}} + {{calc|v1*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}|v1={{#var:Ice Vortex value4}}|%}} × Σ[[Intelligence|Int]]}} [[magic resistance]].

