{{Illusionnotes
| name = Chilling Touch
| desc = Neither functional nor is [[toggled]] {{Symbol|Toggle|On}}.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Chilling Touch
| desc = Cannot acquire active {{M|attack modifiers}}.
| structure = hidden
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Chilling Touch
| desc = Utilizes the caster's current {{M|attack range}} while {{M|Autocast}} is active, manual cast utilizes the ability's current {{M|cast range}}.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Chilling Touch is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
*** The ability component can be applied by [[instant attack]] sources.
** Both {{M|Autocast}} and an active cast uses Kaldr's current {{M|attack range}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component can be applied by other [[instant attack]] sources.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|chilling_touch_slow}}
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{A|Ancient Apparition|Bone Chill}}
**# Kaldr's attack instance.
** The first three ability components do not affect the following units:
*** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Chilling Touch icon0}}
| desc = Enhances Ancient Apparition's attack with increased range and a burst of magical damage and slow.
}}
<hr>
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Grants {{#var:Chilling Touch basic1}} bonus {{M|attack range}} based on the caster's attack range type.
** Hence, both {{M|Autocast}} and an active cast uses Kaldr's current {{M|attack range}}.

