fields.value:

{{Stealnotes
| name = Ice Blast
| desc = Grants {{A|Ancient Apparition|Ice Blast}} if this {{M|sub-ability}} is the last cast ability.
}}

 * {{Symbol|a|sub}}
** Replaces {{A|Ancient Apparition|Ice Blast}} until the [[sub-ability]] is used or the tracer projectile disappears.
** Can be cast despite being affected by {{M|silence}} sources.
** Kaldr is unable to level Ice Blast up while this sub-ability is active.

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** The tracer [[projectile]] is only released in the following conditions:
*** Upon the sub-ability cast.
*** Upon Kaldr's {{M|death}} while the tracer is still traveling.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*** The ability effects are visible to everyone. However, it is not visible on the minimap.

 * {{Symbol|Projectile|Speed}}
** The projectile does not travel more than its max travel time.
** Hence, the projectile speed exceeds its min travel speed, if the travel distance upon released is {{Code|< {{#expr:{{#var:Release value1}}*{{#var:Release value2}}}}-distance}}.

